Introduction:
   This project implements a Flask web application 
   integrated with MongoDB Atlas. The application provides 
   a JSON API route at /api that reads data from a backend JSON file 
   and returns it as a JSON response. It also provides a frontend form 
   that accepts user information and stores the submitted data in
   MongoDB Atlas. The application includes success handling through 
   redirection to a success page and error handling that displays the 
   error on the same form page.


Tools and Tecnologies:
     Python
     Flask
